# Vendored reference snapshot for the honest-framework reference test: a local,
# regenerable copy of honest-framework/python/app.py. Not committed, to avoid a
# confusing duplicate of another repo's file; the test falls back to the sibling
# honest-framework checkout and skips if neither is present.
tools/l1_analyzer/tests/reference/honest_framework_app.txt

# Local Paper A v2 run scratch (results, logs, summary). An experimental arm, so it
# lives under research/arms/ rather than inside the implementation it happens to drive.
research/arms/paper-a-v2/

